{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026seIcIi407d1794216788.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普日前簽署公告，將白宮橢圓形辦公室及內閣會議廳，列為國家紀念地，稱要防止未來的總統修改他的設計。</p><p></p><p>特朗普自去年1月重返白宮後，對白宮實行「大改造」，他在橢圓形辦公室加上大量「金碧輝煌」的裝飾，與上一任總統拜登時期相比，盡顯奢華。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261109_QQ.WHITEHOUSE.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m6gQf6qG1h1794219216.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>特朗普在白宮南草坪興建新的直升機停機坪，今年9月21日正式啟用。</p><p></p><p>而最矚目的要數白宮宴會廳改造，白宮東翼去年開始拆除，不過計劃惹來國家歷史保護信託基金會的訴訟。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261109_QQ.WHITEHOUSE.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sc5Ol66Dd31794219202.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>白宮西翼的玫瑰園亦煥然一新，特朗普將草坪換成石地，並加入華盛頓、富蘭克林等多尊歷史名人雕像。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261109_QQ.WHITEHOUSE.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Z6IMz2TwzF1794219548.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>雖然特朗普將白宮部分區域，列為國家紀念地，但只要歷史結構及建築特色不變，日後總統大可改動有關區域的裝潢。特朗普的「傑作」未來能否獲得保留，大家拭目而待。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12283-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E7%B6%B1%E8%A6%81%E6%B3%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.816777+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:29.798143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:25.216914+00:00","content_hash":"153045a9451e7699832b4162ebeb43699675a27abdda71c05bd3a2ac463108a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.816777+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}